00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:24.020
<i>Silver left to
help the hunters -</i>

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>who were attacked
by a red bear..</i>

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:33.370
<i>Instincts awakens and Silver doesn't
doubt even in front of a giant bear.</i>

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:39.450
<i>But the bear wasn't Akakabuto,
it was one of his cubs.</i>

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:45.040
<i>Akakabuto was building a fortress
into the mountain pass.</i>

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:51.290
<i>On the way home Silver
rescues Daisuke from the ravine.</i>

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:57.630
<i>It made Silver and Daisuke
even closer friends.</i>

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:05.020
<i>By risking his own life,
Silver made a friend of a lifetime.</i>

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:15.030
The challenge of Akakabuto's bear family!

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:34.640
Jump!

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:49.350
Come on, jump!
- Grandpa?

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:57.830
Are you awake?

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:06.660
Daisuke, where am I?
- In the hospital of Hidetoshi.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:14.290
So you're awake?
- Why am I in here?

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:18.600
You collapsed while training Silver.

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:23.680
If it wasn't for him, you would've have been in danger.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:30.000
You'll stay here for one more day.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:33.310
Weren't you going back to Tokyo?

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:38.950
I can't just leave Akakabuto be.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:45.320
I'm going to kill him.
- Grandpa!

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:52.210
Next time could be your last one.
I order you to rest.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:56.630
Damn it!
- Calm down grandpa.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:04:01.260
I'll take care of Silver.
You don't need to worry about it.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.650
See you, John!

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:23.420
Come!

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.510
Silver!

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:36.260
Doctor Hidetoshi!

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:40.760
What is he doing?

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.740
Unbelievable!

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:09.950
You mustn't underestimate a bow.
It's better than grandpa's gun.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:15.180
Grandpa's gun?
Sounds unbelievable.

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:17.960
Draw the bow.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:23.920
It's heavy!
- Draw the string tighter.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:34.530
It's a hunting bow.

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:41.980
It's more powerful than Japanese.
And more dangerous than grandpa's gun.

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:47.750
Drawing the bow requires a certain
technique, but especially strength.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:51.950
Strength to draw the bow.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:06:03.890
From a close range it can easily kill
a bear. It goes straight through.

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:09.140
A bow can't be better than a gun...!

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.850
Let me show you something...

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:24.110
I killed that tiger in China.

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:27.370
Look at this picture of a roe...

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:34.450
An arrow pierced it and hit a rock.

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:38.080
Unbelievable!

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:46.350
Did you kill all of these?
- John and I together...

00:06:52.860 --> 00:07:00.160
The methods to hunt are changing.
It's important to have a good partner.

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:03.330
Partner?

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:13.120
Grandpa can't hunt anymore.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:19.000
Not even after he gets out of hospital.

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:35.480
Can't grandpa hunt bears anymore?

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:39.770
Can't grandpa...

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:48.990
What are we going to do Silver?
Maybe we can't take revenge on Akakabuto.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.030
What do you think, Silver?

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:02.580
Where are you going?

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:36.200
Silver...
You mean I should draw this bow?

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:42.870
<i>Silver really means it.
He wants us to hunt Akakabuto.</i>

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:47.550
Okay. From this day on I'm your partner.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:10:01.490
More!
- You're acting weird.

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:09.080
You eat a lot.
- He's growing and 3-4 rice bowls is normal.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:15.140
8!
- 8 bowls? You'll get sick!

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:20.090
What now?
- It's Silver. Thanks for the food!

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:27.310
Silver, come now!

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:35.660
<i>Spring comes late in the north.
The snow in the mountains melts in May.</i>

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:41.380
<i>Akakabuto's clan starts to move
this time of the year.</i>

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:54.720
One and a half month.
That he has worked out that long...

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:56.850
What?

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:09.730
Daisuke!
- Did you see it? I did it.

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:25.240
I have to tell to grandpa,
he'll be delighted!

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:34.340
Grandpa!

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:41.550
Silver, where have you been?
It's time for bear hunting.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.310
Grandpa!

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:51.530
Silver, bring doctor Hidetoshi!

00:11:52.950 --> 00:12:00.610
<i>Silver knew that Gohei was
in danger. He ran to the hospital.</i>

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:14.760
<i>He ran in a speed like
a shooting star.</i>

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:21.800
<i>He flew over the rooftops.
His inherited strength and agility -</i>

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:27.980
<i>in Daisuke's training
pushed his limits over the top.</i>

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:35.950
<i>Daisuke became strong and
Silver became a strong adult.</i>

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:56.500
Don't worry.
You mustn't leave grandpa alone.

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:05.470
Bear... Akakabuto!

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:12.530
Daisuke, I'm going to spend the night here.
You can go to sleep.

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:22.690
Tomorrow!

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:29.030
We will kill Akakabuto.

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:53.270
Floods has destroyed it again!
Same thing every year.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:57.150
We have to cross the river
from the upstream.

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:14.080
Did you see that?
The cubs had a red back!

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:27.260
Remember where they went. They must be
Akakabuto's cubs. Come!

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:53.030
<i>Dr. Hidetoshi, I'm sorry that I took
the hunting bow without permission.</i>

00:14:57.920 --> 00:15:01.790
We can cross from here. Let's go!

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:24.580
There the horses were attacked by a giant bear. The bridge has been destroyed.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:40.180
We can't cross from here.
- We can cross from the upstream.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:44.220
It won't be necessary.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.180
John...

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:56.010
Jump over the river.

00:16:01.820 --> 00:16:05.360
Twist it around the tree!

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:18.240
Ropeway...!

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.450
Bear droppings. Fresh!

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:11.010
Wait!

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:17.760
There's no need to hurry.
Let's eat first.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:28.910
<i>Now that we are in Akakabuto's territory, my legs start to shiver...!</i>

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:53.090
Scary!

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:59.690
I can't eat. Do you want it?

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.360
Quiet!

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:42.020
<i>Daisuke didn't mean to kill the bird.
But the arrow pierced it.</i>

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:47.440
<i>It was the first time Daisuke
had killed a living creature.</i>

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:53.940
<i>Shame and repentance with
amazement from the power of the bow.</i>

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:59.610
<i>It made Daisuke stabilize composure...</i>

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:04.590
Lets go, Silver!

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:25.010
We have to find cover from the rain!

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:30.400
We're going to get soaked!

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.610
That cave is fine!

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:47.410
What now?

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:52.710
Come back!

00:19:57.390 --> 00:19:59.270
Back!

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:17.070
<i>A giant bear!
We won't make it!</i>

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.820
Silver!

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:27.620
No! It will kill you!

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:36.340
<i>The instincts of a bear-hound
prevented him to be afraid.</i>

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:42.380
The moment you're afraid, you'll die.
Silver attacked without a doubt

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:59.730
Lightning struck near.
- There. To the peak!

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:08.550
We can't use rifles before
the thunderstorm is over.

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:17.420
What is it?

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:22.130
<i>Bears woken up from hibernation
don't have much food.</i>

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:27.010
<i>They eat roots,
berries and small animals.</i>

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:32.680
<i>But that's not enough for Akakabuto's
family. They attack the cattle.</i>

00:21:34.570 --> 00:21:38.780
He saw us. Run!
- Wait!

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:46.610
<i>Keep the distance under 600 meters.
Got it, John?</i>

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:48.780
<i>Go!</i>

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:55.960
What am I going to do?

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:19.980
<i>Silver asked Daisuke to help him.
The reason he even attacked the bear -</i>

00:22:20.120 --> 00:22:25.900
<i>was because he trusted in Daisuke.
But Daisuke was terrified -</i>

00:22:26.040 --> 00:22:29.320
<i>and he couldn't muster up to use the bow.</i>

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:44.460
<i>Silver has his limits.
There's no time to lose.</i>

00:22:50.900 --> 00:22:55.810
<i>Silver realized that his
life was in danger.</i>
